  The play triangle out of the disc's hub, alone, on the disc's own 1495-unit canvas.

  Its own drawable so it can be held still while @drawable/ic_wordmark_reel turns underneath it: a
  record spins, a play button does not, and a triangle going round with the grooves reads as a
  loading spinner rather than as a mark. Everything is at the coordinates it was drawn at, so the
  two are stacked at the same size and need no alignment of their own.
-->
